    "intro": {
      "zh": "Microsoft Xbox One 是微软 2013 年发布的第八代家用游戏机，也是微软第三代主机，以 AMD Jaguar 八核处理器、8GB DDR3 内存与蓝光光驱为标志，初期因强制联网与二手限制政策引发争议后调整，与 PS4 形成第八代主机竞争格局。",
      "en": "The Microsoft Xbox One, released in 2013, was Microsoft's third home console and an eighth-generation machine powered by an AMD Jaguar eight-core CPU, defined by an initial online-required policy controversy that was later revised."
    },
    "era": 2013, "manufacturer": "Microsoft"
  },
